status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"y396","quote":"又曰：桓溫自以雄姿風氣，是司馬宣王、劉越石一輩器。有以叱王大將軍者，意大不平。征苻健還，于北方得一巧作老婢，乃是劉越石妓女。一見溫入，潸然而泣。溫問其故，答曰：「官家甚似劉司空。」溫大悅。即出外修整衣冠，又入，呼問：「我何處似司空？」緹答曰：「眼甚似，恨小。面甚似，恨薄。須甚似，恨赤。形甚似，恨短。聲甚似，恨雌。」宣武於是弛冠解帶，不覺惛然而睡。不怡者數日。","raw_start":4144,"raw_end":4324,"raw_line":121},"attribution":{"anthology":"太平御覽","quoted_work":"語林","source_heading":"《語林》曰：","resumption":"又曰"},"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-396-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong","book_id":"b-taipingyulan-396","work_id":"w-taipingyulan","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-396-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-500-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:narrative","text":"又曰：桓溫自以雄姿風氣是宣帝、劉琨之儔，有以比王敦者，意甚不平。及是征還，于北方得一巧作老婢，訪之，乃琨妓女也。一見溫，便潸然而泣。溫問其故，答曰：「公甚似劉司空。」溫大悅，出外整理衣冠，又呼婢問之。婢云：「唇甚似，恨薄；眼甚似，恨小；鬢甚似，恨赤；形甚似，恨短；聲甚似，恨雌。」溫于是癘冠解帶，昏然而睡，不怡者數日。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-taipingyulan-500-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:narrative:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"桓溫","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-500-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:narrative:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"宣帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-500-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:narrative:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"劉琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-500-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:narrative:m0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-500-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:narrative:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-t